  Poultry Products Inspection Act (PPIA) (21 U.S.C. § 451 et seq.)
    → mandatory inspection of poultry products in interstate commerce
    → STATUTORY STABILITY: HIGH
  Egg Products Inspection Act (EPIA) (21 U.S.C. § 1031 et seq.)
    → processed-egg-products inspection
    → STATUTORY STABILITY: HIGH
  FMIA § 1902 humane slaughter / ritual slaughter exemption
    → slaughter-level halal / kosher framework
    → STATUTORY STABILITY: HIGH
