  PA Food Safety Act (3 P.S. § 5701 et seq.)
    → state-level food code; coordination with PADA at retail
  PA Retail Food Facility Safety Act (3 P.S. § 5721 et seq.)
    → retail-level enforcement
  PA non-cooperative MPI status
    → PA elects not to operate state Meat and Poultry Inspection program;
      federal-direct inspection concentrates on FSIS District 60

