## §8. Pathway tracing — specific breakdown points

**Pathway 1 breakdown point** [D]: IRA MFP pricing protection effective Jan 1, 2026 + pharmacy desert post-Rite-Aid simultaneous = pricing-vs-access paradox at the constituent fill-completion layer. Structural cause: federal pricing tool operative without dependency on pharmacy-density; physical access geography determines reach.

**Pathway 2 breakdown point** [D + SD]: suspicious-order monitoring + pharmacy availability + methadone-vs-buprenorphine racial-pattern asymmetry; cross-ref SD6.

**Pathway 3 breakdown point** [D]: SVI 30-40% closure correlation [Source 28] = closure pattern concentrates on compound-disadvantage tracts; sub-area variation by closure concentration.

**Pathway 4 breakdown point** [D + SD]: specialty pharmacy access asymmetry by health-system affiliation; independents functionally excluded from biologic-dispensing pathway; small clinical practices vs. major health systems carry differential referral pathway access.

