## §8. Pathway tracing — specific breakdown points

**Pathway 1 breakdown point** [D + SD]: Casgevy / Lyfgenia uptake at Penn / CHOP pending quantification (F4-T2P2-SD4-1 P1). Structural cause: cost + ATC capacity + multi-month treatment cycle + 15-year monitoring + clinical trial diversity gap legacy.

**Pathway 2 breakdown point** [D]: federal-state operational coherence stress during litigation period; vaccine administration vector reduction post-pharmacy-desert. Structural cause: federal flux + state operational dependency on federal coherence + cross-cut SD3.

**Pathway 3 breakdown point** [D]: LDT vacatur leaves federal premarket validation pathway absent; CLIA-only oversight insufficient. Structural cause: regulatory-tool absence + documented racial-pattern bias persistence + XC-11 small-practice burden.

