**North/Northwest Philadelphia Core** [D]: **Kensington-adjacent boundary intersects northern portion of N./Northwest Phila Core; documented compound-incidence locus partially within PA-3 boundary; SD1 + SD3 + SD5 + SD6 simultaneous concentration most acute at this sub-area boundary**; concentrated unhoused population (cross-cut Source 35 Prevention Point 83% unhoused); harm-reduction services concentrated.

