April 2025 FDA RIF: ~3,500 RIF; ~20% workforce loss through early 2026 [D]; per-Center allocation flagged F4-T2P2-SD7-1 P1. CDER 5-director sequence in 2025 [D]. CBER + CDRH leadership uncertainty [D]. CTP Office of Regulations decimation [D]. April 2025 USDA workforce reductions (11,300+ deferred resignations) [D]; FSIS District 60 staffing actuals flagged. USDA ERS Household Food Security report series terminated with 2024 edition [D]; replacement-data-source status pending; F4-T2P2-SD7-2 P1.

Documented rule changes 2025-2026: LDT vacatur March 31, 2025 [D, Source 24]; menthol withdrawal RIN 0910-AI60 January 2025 [D]; characterizing-flavors-in-cigars rule withdrawal [D]; Salmonella Framework withdrawal April 25, 2025 (90 FR 17344) [D]; ACIP overhaul + vaccine policy litigation flux June 2025 → March 2026 federal court block [D, Source 21]; today-effective DEA Schedule III April 29, 2026 [D, FR Doc. 2026-08176].

PA-3 cross-cutting infrastructure: FDA Philadelphia District (Mellon Independence Center) operates across SD1 + SD3 + SD4 + SD5 — federal-cluster anchor point; FSIS Philadelphia District 60 at same address operates SD2 federal layer. Penn / CHOP / Jefferson / Temple academic medical centers operate as anchor at SD3 + SD4 + SD6. PDPH operates as primary local-cluster anchor across SD1 + SD2 + SD5 + SD6.

